graph TD
    A[Misfolded Protein Detection] --> B{Protein Location?}
    B -->|Cytoplasm| C[Hsp70 Recognition]
    B -->|ER| D[BiP Recognition]
    B -->|Mitochondria| E[Hsp60 Recognition]
    
    C --> F[Refolding Attempt]
    F --> G{Refolding Successful?}
    G -->|Yes| H[Functional Protein]
    G -->|No| I[Ubiquitin Tagging]
    
    D --> J[ERAD Pathway]
    J --> K[Retrotranslocation]
    K --> I
    
    E --> L[Mitochondrial QC]
    L --> M[Protease Degradation]
    M --> N[Mitochondrial Protein Degradation]
    
    I --> O[Proteasome Targeting]
    O --> P[Protein Degradation]
    P --> Q[Quality Control Complete]
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    A --> R[Aggregation Prevention]
    R --> S[Chaperone Sequestration]
    S --> T[Aggresome Formation]
    T --> U[Selective Autophagy]
    U --> V[Aggregate Clearance]
    
    %% Key proteins
    W[Hsp70] --> C
    X[BiP] --> D
    Y[Hsp60] --> E
    Z[Ubiquitin] --> I
    AA[Proteasome] --> O
    BB[Chaperones] --> S
    CC[Autophagy Machinery] --> U
    
